{"recordId":"general_龐煖_306747005","name":"龐煖","type":"general","dynasty":"戰國","title":"暮年合縱","canonicalName":null,"aliases":[],"identityStatus":"candidate","candidatePages":[{"title":"庞煖","pageId":1619511,"revisionId":92667317,"revisionTimestamp":"2026-05-15T12:13:40Z","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%BA%9E%E7%85%96","revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92667317","wikidataId":"Q5948390","isDisambiguation":false,"bibliography":[{"citationTitle":"《史記志疑》","url":null,"type":"citation-template","template":"cite book","author":"梁玉繩","publisher":"中華書局","date":"1981年4月","isbn":"978-7-101-05109-4","locator":"citation template"},{"citationTitle":"《戰國史料編年輯證》","url":null,"type":"citation-template","template":"cite book","author":"楊寬","publisher":"上海人民出版社","date":"2001年11月","isbn":"7208031851","locator":"citation template"},{"citationTitle":"《先秦诸子系年考辨》","url":null,"type":"citation-template","template":"cite book","author":"钱穆","publisher":"上海书店","date":"1992年","isbn":"7805694745","locator":"citation template"},{"citationTitle":"鶡冠子·近叠","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"鶡冠子·武靈王","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"鶡冠子·世賢","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"史記·卷三十四·燕召公世家","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"史記·卷四十三·趙世家","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"史記志疑","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"史記·卷七十八·春申君列傳","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"戰國史料編年輯證","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"史記·卷六·秦始皇本紀","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"韓非子·飾邪","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"汉书·卷三十·艺文志","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"先秦诸子系年考辨","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"东周列国志·第一百零三回·李国舅争权除黄歇 樊於期传檄讨秦王","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"}],"wikisourceLinks":[],"retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T10:36:07.511Z","attribution":{"source":"Chinese Wikipedia contributors","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0; bibliography metadata only","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","status":"candidate index, not independently verified evidence"}}],"sourceIds":["source:shiji","source:hanshu","source:zizhitongjian"],"reviewIds":[],"claimIds":[],"matches":[{"documentId":"document:shiji-79afd3fa99a04e3a","query":"龐煖","count":4,"offset":2967,"excerpt":"，攻樂乘，樂乘走，廉頗奔大梁。十二年，趙使李牧攻燕，拔武遂、方城。劇辛故居趙，與龐煖善，已而亡走燕。燕見趙數困于秦，而廉頗去，令龐煖將也，欲因趙獘攻之。問劇辛，辛曰：「龐煖易與耳。」燕使劇辛將撃趙，趙使龐煖撃之，取燕軍二萬，殺劇辛。秦拔魏二十城","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:shiji-dbd8bcdcdc9d1c85","query":"龐煖","count":2,"offset":13972,"excerpt":"者言行信於王，王必厚割趙而贖平都。」文信侯曰：「善。」因遣之。城韓皋。\n\n三年，龐煖將，攻燕，禽其將劇辛。四年，龐煖將趙、楚、魏、燕之鋭師，攻秦蕞，不拔；移攻齊，取饒安。五年，傅抵將，居平邑；慶舍將東陽河外師，守河梁。六年，封長安君以饒。魏與趙","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:hanshu-eb969eba8b9bb8ea","query":"龐煖","count":1,"offset":22117,"excerpt":"侯嬴　朱亥　左師觸龍　　韓王安〔為秦所滅。〕\n|\n\n　藺相如　　平原君　春申君　龐煖〔師古曰：「煖音許元反，又音許遠反。」〕\n| 燕孝王〔四十二世，武成王子。〕\n|　\n\n　　　毛遂　秦孝文王〔昭襄王子。〕\n|　　　\n\n　　朱英　蒙恬　　　李園　","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:hanshu-901525b53a697d6b","query":"龐煖","count":2,"offset":6147,"excerpt":"之利，因以非禮，推兼愛之意，而不知別親疏。\n\n縱橫家\n\n蘇子三十一篇，張子十篇，龐煖二篇，闕子一篇，國筮子十七篇，秦零陵令信一篇。\n\n蒯子五篇，鄒陽七篇，主父偃二十八篇，徐樂一篇，莊安一篇，待詔金馬聊蒼三篇。\n\n右從橫十二家，百七篇。\n\n從橫家","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:zizhitongjian-d0f3dd0b49755bdb","query":"龐煖","count":4,"offset":7679,"excerpt":"、《蒙恬列傳》並作「二十」，據改。〕；初置東郡。\n----\n\n2　初，劇辛在趙與龐煖善，已而仕燕。燕王見趙數困於秦，廉頗去而龐煖為將，欲因其敝而攻之，問於劇辛，對曰：「龐煖易與耳。」燕王使劇辛將而伐趙。趙龐煖禦之，殺劇辛，取燕師二萬。\n----","matchType":"name-occurrence"}],"matchCount":5,"gaps":["身份連結尚未完成編輯核對；同名、異名或同時代關係可能有誤配。","原人物分析及能力數值尚未逐句核對。","來源中的年代、關係與評價仍需逐條轉成有出處的主張。"],"notes":["姓名／重新導向命中，人物身份與每條書目尚須逐項核對。","姓名、分類、時代及稱號保留原庫資料，不自動視為史實。"],"version":"b66c5a60a41e2334","matchedDocuments":[{"id":"document:shiji-79afd3fa99a04e3a","bookId":"book:shiji","requestedTitle":"史記/卷034","title":"史記/卷034","sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E5%8F%B2%E8%A8%98%2F%E5%8D%B7034","revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2559287","historyUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E5%8F%B2%E8%A8%98%2F%E5%8D%B7034?action=history","revisionId":2559287,"revisionTimestamp":"2025-05-07T07:55:56Z","retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T10:34:04.009Z","sha256":"1272482052e66a8b5072dd71e7e539f4cce0b36bdfefe73a8e1fe5cac0ddc823","textSha256":"e70a7d332b725559e831ec128347a404dd848be3aa1288fb4a0cf1bfdc777720","expandedWikitextSha256":"1272482052e66a8b5072dd71e7e539f4cce0b36bdfefe73a8e1fe5cac0ddc823","characters":3354,"contentPath":"/static/data/history/archive-books/shiji.json","status":"downloaded","acquisitionStatus":"downloaded","reuse":"Ancient underlying text; Wikisource transcription attribution and CC BY-SA 4.0 for applicable contributions","extraction":"wikitext-conservative-v2.1.0","normalizedAt":"2026-10-02T11:14:35.104Z","upstreamTextQuality":null,"upstreamTextQualityMeaning":"Wikisource platform quality marker; not a percentage of text transcribed","textCompleteness":"not-independently-collated","extractionNotes":[],"expandedTransclusionTitles":[],"transclusionIssues":[],"transclusions":[],"textPath":"/static/data/history/web/releases/b66c5a60a41e2334/documents/668380959b3c257951cb.json","wikitextPath":"/static/data/history/web/releases/b66c5a60a41e2334/wikitext/668380959b3c257951cb.json","relatedDocumentIds":[]},{"id":"document:shiji-dbd8bcdcdc9d1c85","bookId":"book:shiji","requestedTitle":